  "Combat.TentacleBeast.Struggle.AsTheCreatureAttemptsToAdjust": "As the creature attempts to adjust your position in its grip, you free one of your [legs] and hit the beast in its beak, causing it to let out an inhuman cry and drop you to the ground smartly.[pg]"
